This project will use the Windows Media Foundation virtual-camera API.

During development, the team consulted the following MIT-licensed public
reference implementations for API behavior and interoperability:

- Microsoft Windows-Camera VirtualCamera sample
  https://github.com/microsoft/Windows-Camera/tree/master/Samples/VirtualCamera
- Julian's windows-ir-camera-viewer
  https://github.com/aphongdo/windows-ir-camera-viewer
- Felipe Ramm's webcam-wallpaper virtual camera
  https://github.com/feliperamm/webcam-wallpaper

The native virtual-camera foundation in `native/` is derived from the
MIT-licensed `webcam-wallpaper` virtual camera implementation. Its original
copyright and license are reproduced in `THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md`.
